/-! # Compact data for the cheap Twelfth source vector

Literal compact packed tensors (data only; each is checked by the kernel where it is used):
the tensors of the incoming Twelfth vector after the monomial letters and after the whole first
and second stage of its source word (`twelfthS0mLit` over `1`, `twelfthS0Lit` over `8`,
`twelfthS1mLit` over `8`, all of field width `2`; `twelfthS1Lit` over `32`, width `3`), the
Twelfth tensor (`twelfthX12Lit`, over `32`, width `4`), and the Twelfth pair
terms at short scale `1 / 128` (`twelfthSrcPairs128`). -/

